   "source": [
    "# ComfyUI Local Runner - Google Colab\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook sets up ComfyUI with all custom nodes for reference-based character generation.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Features\n",
    "- CivitAI model downloader\n",
    "- Reference image collection (up to 10)\n",
    "- Pose search & OpenPose integration\n",
    "- Face/Hand detailer with YOLO\n",
    "- ToonOut background removal\n",
    "- Google Drive integration\n",
    "\n",
    "## How to Use\n",
    "1. Run all cells in order\n",
    "2. Click the local URL to open ComfyUI\n",
    "3. Load the workflow from `workflows/reference_character_workflow.json`"
   ]
  },
  {
